{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星迪麗熱巴前晚現身活動氣場全開，化身「蝴蝶仙子」艷壓群芳，連壓軸嘉賓劉亦菲亦因不在狀態而被熱巴成功搶焦。</p><p>同場的白鹿與孟子義則你推我讓，不肯站在娜扎身旁合照惹熱話。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;陸劇女神迪麗熱巴、劉亦菲、白</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:20:34.620451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T16:00:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:18:05.302636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T16:18:05.302636+00:00","content_hash":"5e5000786bc01a65e362943990335e3c1c0c42ca26744823a74fe16078fedd35","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}